## 3. Content Widgets — Text Box

### Add a text box widget
- Click **"+ Text Box"** in the editor toolbar.
- A floating text box widget appears on the canvas.

### Text Box Features
- **Editable title** — click the title field to rename the text box.
- **Rich text editing** — click the text area to enter edit mode (HTML-based via QTextEdit).
- **Formatting toolbar** — each text block has its own formatting buttons:
  - **B** — Bold
  - **I** — Italic
  - **H1** — Heading 1 (24pt)
  - **H2** — Heading 2 (18pt)
  - **Link** — Insert hyperlink
  - **•** — Bullet list
  - **Alignment** — Left, Center, Right
  - **Size** — Font size selector (9–32pt)
- **Multiple blocks** — add multiple text blocks within a single text box via "T+ Text" button.
- **Remove block** — click "✕ Remove" on any block to delete it.

### Text Box Sub-blocks
- **Checklist blocks** — click "✓ List" to add an inline checklist within the text box.
- **Table blocks** — click "⊞ Table" to add an inline table within the text box.
- **Image blocks** — click "🖼 Image" to add an image (from file or URL).
- **Fun imports** — click " Fun" to open the emoji/GIF picker.

### Resize & Position
- **Drag header** to move the text box anywhere on the canvas.
- **Drag edges** (left, right, top, bottom) to resize.
- **Drag corners** to resize both width and height simultaneously.
- Position and size are persisted in the database.

---

## 4. Content Widgets — Tables

### Add a table widget
- Click **"+ Table"** in the editor toolbar.

### Modify table structure
- **"+ Row"** / **"- Row"** — add/remove the last row (minimum 1 row).
- **"+ Col"** / **"- Col"** — add/remove the last column (minimum 1 column).
- **"#"** — toggle row number column.

### Edit cells
- Click any cell and type.
- **Tab** / **Shift+Tab** — navigate to next/previous cell (wraps between rows).
- **Tab in last cell of last row** — automatically adds a new row and moves focus to it.

### Column headers
- Double-click a column header to rename it inline.

### Resize & Position
- **Drag header** to move the table anywhere on the canvas.
- **Drag edges** to resize.
- Position and size are persisted in the database.

---

## 5. Content Widgets — Checklists

### Add a checklist widget
- Click **"+ Checklist"** in the editor toolbar.

### Checklist Features
- **Editable title** — click the title field to rename the checklist.
- **Add items** — click "+ Add item" to add new checkbox items.
- **Check/uncheck** — click the checkbox to toggle state.
- **Edit text** — click the text field to edit item text.
- **Delete items** — click "×" on any item to delete it.
- **Enter key** — pressing Enter in an item creates a new item below.

### Resize & Position
- **Drag header** to move the checklist anywhere on the canvas.
- **Drag edges** to resize.
- Position and size are persisted in the database.

