## 6. Fun Imports (Emoji & GIF Support)

### Access Fun Imports
- Click " Fun" button in any text box widget's header.
- Or click "Fun Imports" in the sidebar's special folders section.

### Emoji Picker
- **Categorized tabs** — Smileys, Gestures, Hearts, Animals, Food, Activities, Travel, Objects.
- **Search** — type to filter emojis by category name or emoji content.
- **Category navigation** — click category icons to scroll to that section.
- **Custom emojis** — upload custom emoji images via the Upload tab.

### GIF Browser
- **Categories** — Trending, Reactions, Celebrations.
- **Custom GIFs** — upload custom GIF files via the Upload tab.
- GIFs are inserted as HTML `<img>` tags with local file URLs.

### Upload Tab
- Upload custom emoji images (PNG, JPG, JPEG, GIF, SVG).
- Upload custom GIF files (GIF).
- Uploaded files appear in their respective tabs.

