## 9. Window Layout & Responsiveness

- The splitter between sidebar and editor is **draggable**.
- Window resizes gracefully; test at **1024×768** and **1920×1080**.
- Sidebar has `minWidth=180`.
- Splitter sizes are persisted across sessions.
- Sidebar has its own vertical splitter between the page tree and template tree.

